WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.741
Anthropic migrated

00:00:01.553 --> 00:00:02.956
its Messages API

00:00:02.767 --> 00:00:03.840
from Python to

00:00:03.652 --> 00:00:04.324
Rust

00:00:04.854 --> 00:00:06.363
API traffic grew

00:00:06.187 --> 00:00:08.368
roughly 1,800 times

00:00:08.179 --> 00:00:09.854
from early 2024

00:00:09.665 --> 00:00:11.127
to fall 2026

00:00:11.234 --> 00:00:12.707
and Python overhead

00:00:12.519 --> 00:00:13.474
in validation

00:00:13.616 --> 00:00:14.559
tokenization

00:00:14.748 --> 00:00:16.068
safety screening and

00:00:15.880 --> 00:00:17.165
stream parsing became

00:00:16.977 --> 00:00:17.825
a bottleneck

00:00:18.358 --> 00:00:19.737
Public traffic moved

00:00:19.549 --> 00:00:20.350
to Rust in

00:00:20.162 --> 00:00:22.273
September 2026 without

00:00:22.084 --> 00:00:23.192
downtime or a

00:00:23.004 --> 00:00:24.077
feature freeze

00:00:24.614 --> 00:00:25.805
The effort required

00:00:25.616 --> 00:00:26.489
to undertake the

00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:27.562
project was dropping

00:00:27.373 --> 00:00:28.069
fast

00:00:28.199 --> 00:00:29.932
by May 2026

00:00:30.074 --> 00:00:31.088
Claude was writing

00:00:30.899 --> 00:00:32.467
more than 80%

00:00:32.279 --> 00:00:33.057
of the code

00:00:32.869 --> 00:00:34.189
Anthropic merged

00:00:34.710 --> 00:00:35.724
Full story on

00:00:35.535 --> 00:00:36.431
the dashboard
